{"schema_version": 2, "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "effort": "medium", "params": {"n": 10007, "k": 64}, "seed": 1921981004, "solved": "solved", "parsed": true, "verify_ok": true, "verify_reason": "ok", "reply": "Looking at this problem, I derived that P(u,v)\u00b7(u+v+uv) = u^p+v^p+u^p v^p mod p (via Frobenius), which gives the recurrence c(i+1,j) = -c(i,j) - c(i,j+1). Solving this recurrence with boundary conditions shows:\n\n**c(i,j) = 0 if i+j < p-1, and c(i,j) = (-1)^i mod p if i+j = p-1**\n\nUsing this, I evaluated each query and applied the matrix transformations.\n\n<answer>[[0, 0], [941, 6008], [5905, 7654], [183, 7527], [5352, 8996], [0, 0], [4025, 4622], [6165, 8981], [8183, 4673], [0, 0], [6537, 461], [0, 0], [1344, 5784], [8784, 8737], [10056, 2432], [773, 1491], [9135, 669], [252, 6248], [0, 0], [0, 0], [0, 0], [0, 0], [1634, 4824], [7033, 5221], [6771, 488], [2287, 4146], [3233, 2106], [4780, 4212], [10089, 2428], [9669, 9683], [7248, 8389], [2058, 9905]]</answer>", "error": null, "elapsed_sec": 128.34, "http_status": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "preset": "medium", "escalation_round": 1}
